flowchart TB
	TRIGGER["fs/observed (target, {kind:present, version}, actor)<br/>fired by the TOOL LAYER ONLY, for every<br/>harness write/edit, any thread"]
	TRIGGER --> G1["G1 Factory.Gate: displayPath → actor ∈ mutationTools<br/>→ kind present → Stash idempotence →<br/>basename package.json → excluded?"]
	G1 -. "excluded" .-> SKIP["ledger skipped (excluded) (path)<br/>(every other gate outcome is silent)"]
	G1 --> G2["G2 Factory.Discover + Factory.Parse:<br/>nearest registry.json walk-up"]
	G2 -. "none / unreadable" .-> SKIP2["ledger line, the chain pass is skipped"]
	G2 --> SEED["Stash seed (targetKey, version) - our own<br/>re-emits re-enter as no-ops"]
	SEED -- "detached, contained (Factory.Continue - the listener never awaits)" --> G3["G3 CHAIN PASS (the pure transform): read →<br/>chain-governed pins (dep ∈ registry.effectiveLatest)<br/>canonicalized to ^resolved, strict: strip unknown<br/>(explicit only, never a default) → GuardedWrite<br/>(replaceIfVersion + the P4 fence) → ledger<br/>governed (path) → (version) → Refresh (P3 re-emit, same actor)"]
	G3 -.- NOTE["the factory's Continue also computes the union keep-list<br/>with the P3 chain keys - deliberately ignored by this transform"]
	G3 -- "chained off the settled continuation" --> G4["G4 UPDATE STAGE: passage gate → Filter (nothing public? skip)<br/>→ first-wins update-policy pick → Dispatch: breaker → in-flight<br/>→ cooldown → the jobs envelope (kind governor-update, unowned)<br/>or the detached fallback"]
	G4 --> PROG["updateMode programmatic: ncu.run({packageFile, upgrade, silent, dep,<br/>concurrency, target, reject ∪ chain deps, allow, filter}) - no external binary"]
	G4 --> BIN["updateMode bin: the ncu binary (ncuBin) via ctx.subprocess"]
	PROG --> VER["Verify (verifyCommand, exit 127 non-fatal) → Settle →<br/>Refresh (U2: re-stat + re-emit the fresh version)"]
	BIN --> VER
	VER --> END["SILENCE: the tool result shows exactly what the author wrote.<br/>The governed state is discoverable only by a subsequent read - or in the ledger."]
